WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Choose a destination to start the guided application.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.167
Open the guided chat.

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:13.167
Confirm the traveller’s current location.

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:18.167
Answer the residency question.

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:23.167
Provide a contact number for application updates. The value is masked.

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:28.167
Confirm how many people are travelling.

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:33.167
Review the configured visa option. Requirements and prices are recorded examples.

00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:36.417
Read the document requirements for the selected option.

00:00:36.417 --> 00:00:39.583
Select the option and continue the guided application.

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:44.583
Create or sign in to an account. Credential entry is omitted.

00:00:44.583 --> 00:00:49.583
Upload a passport bio page. Personal details and account values are masked.

00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:54.583
Follow the passport-image guidance before uploading.

00:00:54.583 --> 00:01:02.833
Watch extraction and validation, then review the populated fields.

00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:07.833
Check and correct the extracted information before continuing.

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:12.833
Follow the photograph guidance.

00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:17.833
Continue the supporting-document questions.

00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:24.833
The order is sent to the service team; payment is pending. This is not government submission.

00:01:24.833 --> 00:01:27.833
Track the service workflow and resume saved drafts.
